        "paragraph_id": "47EC16B4",
        "text": "Given the complex motion in the breaking waves, we can only give approximate estimates of the order of magnitude of the parameters in the (2.37) till (2.41). Various authors have suggested that the velocity in the roller can be approximated as purely horizontal and equal to the wave celerity cg. In that case we get (for waves travelling in x-direction):"
